{"deep": true, "lines": [{"x0": 398.03314208984375, "y0": 198.28125, "x1": 618.5462646484375, "y1": 236.25, "text": "通信电子电路", "score": 0.9972634613513947, "partial": false, "done": true}, {"x0": 404.9674987792969, "y0": 337.5, "x1": 1816.8062744140625, "y1": 369.84375, "text": "以看到一片杂乱无章的所谓“芽", "score": 0.9789017481463296, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 403.58062744140625, "y0": 392.34375, "x1": 1818.193115234375, "y1": 424.6875, "text": "此等等。这些接收机内部产生", "score": 0.9990602135658264, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 404.9674987792969, "y0": 447.1875, "x1": 1242.6400146484375, "y1": 479.53125, "text": "零频率开始一直到几万兆赫以", "score": 0.9937127782748296, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 474.3112487792969, "y0": 499.21875, "x1": 1816.8062744140625, "y1": 537.1875, "text": "设备内部噪声对有用信号影响", "score": 0.9989716135538541, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 404.9674987792969, "y0": 556.875, "x1": 1816.8062744140625, "y1": 589.21875, "text": "比设备内部噪声大得多，这时噪", "score": 0.9973341865198952, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 402.1937561035156, "y0": 610.3125, "x1": 1819.580078125, "y1": 646.875, "text": "信号可能十分微弱，相比之下，", "score": 0.9980782057557788, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 402.1937561035156, "y0": 665.15625, "x1": 1815.41943359375, "y1": 700.3125, "text": "例如在卫星通信系统中，从遥远", "score": 0.9738888995988029, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 404.9674987792969, "y0": 721.40625, "x1": 1818.193115234375, "y1": 753.75, "text": "部噪声可能比有用信号大得多，", "score": 0.9607180207967758, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 402.1937561035156, "y0": 773.4375, "x1": 1145.558837890625, "y1": 811.40625, "text": "至使通信中断，所以应降低干扰和噪声的影响。", "score": 0.9974407014392671, "partial": false, "done": true}, {"x0": 474.3112487792969, "y0": 831.09375, "x1": 1819.580078125, "y1": 867.65625, "text": "通信系统的外部干扰，通过适当", "score": 0.9726371679987226, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 402.1937561035156, "y0": 885.9375, "x1": 1819.580078125, "y1": 922.5, "text": "际上是一个相当复杂和难解决", "score": 0.9979768945620611, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 403.58062744140625, "y0": 942.1875, "x1": 1818.193115234375, "y1": 974.53125, "text": "种妥善的办法解决。通信设备", "score": 0.9979573900883014, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 402.1937561035156, "y0": 992.8125, "x1": 1818.193115234375, "y1": 1030.78125, "text": "消除的一种干扰，所以它是影响", "score": 0.9924105363232749, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 403.58062744140625, "y0": 1051.875, "x1": 1815.41943359375, "y1": 1084.21875, "text": "就必须了解它的来源和特点，", "score": 0.9957423026745136, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 403.58062744140625, "y0": 1106.71875, "x1": 981.9075317382812, "y1": 1139.0625, "text": "端网络内部噪声进行计算和测量等。", "score": 0.9988004341721535, "partial": false, "done": true}, {"x0": 477.08502197265625, "y0": 1162.96875, "x1": 1814.0325927734375, "y1": 1195.3125, "text": "应该指出的是，噪声问题涉及的", "score": 0.9983500284808022, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 404.9674987792969, "y0": 1217.8125, "x1": 1314.757568359375, "y1": 1250.15625, "text": "面仅对上述问题作一些简要介", "score": 0.9974926480880151, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 393.87249755859375, "y0": 1328.90625, "x1": 815.4825439453125, "y1": 1380.9375, "text": "9.2电阻热噪声", "score": 0.9993903115391731, "partial": false, "done": true}, {"x0": 396.6462707519531, "y0": 1462.5, "x1": 841.8331298828125, "y1": 1504.6875, "text": "9.2.1电阻热噪声现象", "score": 0.998415062824885, "partial": false, "done": true}, {"x0": 478.4718933105469, "y0": 1559.53125, "x1": 1815.41943359375, "y1": 1591.875, "text": "电阻是具有一定阻值的导体，内", "score": 0.9961653053760529, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 404.9674987792969, "y0": 1614.375, "x1": 1816.8062744140625, "y1": 1646.71875, "text": "强度由电阻的温度决定，温度愈", "score": 0.9958618921892983, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 404.9674987792969, "y0": 1670.625, "x1": 1816.8062744140625, "y1": 1702.96875, "text": "止。电阻中每个电子运动的方", "score": 0.9982530749761142, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 404.9674987792969, "y0": 1725.46875, "x1": 1818.193115234375, "y1": 1757.8125, "text": "无规则电流，由于它随时间不断", "score": 0.9883706569671631, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 403.58062744140625, "y0": 1780.3125, "x1": 1818.193115234375, "y1": 1812.65625, "text": "象，把它引起的噪声叫起伏噪声", "score": 0.9913680723735264, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 400.806884765625, "y0": 1830.9375, "x1": 1819.580078125, "y1": 1868.90625, "text": "声。起伏噪声电流在电阻内流", "score": 0.9972698321709266, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 402.1937561035156, "y0": 1890.0, "x1": 1816.8062744140625, "y1": 1922.34375, "text": "起伏噪声电动势）。由于电子质", "score": 0.9592910004513604, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 402.1937561035156, "y0": 1943.4375, "x1": 1815.41943359375, "y1": 1975.78125, "text": "流是无数个非周期性窄脉冲叠", "score": 0.9981531042319077, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 403.58062744140625, "y0": 2001.09375, "x1": 1816.8062744140625, "y1": 2033.4375, "text": "路程所决定，即脉冲宽度等于电", "score": 0.9977842909949166, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 396.6462707519531, "y0": 2044.6875, "x1": 1822.353759765625, "y1": 2096.71875, "text": "10-13～10-4s的数量级。各非周期性脉冲电流的极性、大小和出现的时间都是不确定", "score": 0.9502898213409242, "partial": false, "done": true}, {"x0": 402.1937561035156, "y0": 2109.375, "x1": 1206.581298828125, "y1": 2145.9375, "text": "的。因此，它们的合成电流时大", "score": 0.9981749355792999, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 395.2593994140625, "y0": 2197.96875, "x1": 1055.411865234375, "y1": 2241.5625, "text": "9.2.2电阻热噪声的功率密度频谱", "score": 0.997421871213352, "partial": false, "done": true}, {"x0": 477.08502197265625, "y0": 2295.0, "x1": 1818.193115234375, "y1": 2331.5625, "text": "电阻热噪声是起伏噪声，它的电", "score": 0.9928073925631387, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 404.9674987792969, "y0": 2356.875, "x1": 1818.193115234375, "y1": 2389.21875, "text": "人们发现它的均方值（即各瞬时", "score": 0.9954410791397095, "partial": true, "done": true}, {"x0": 1209.35498046875, "y0": 2400.46875, "x1": 1531.1099853515625, "y1": 2491.875, "text": "PDF", "score": 0.9907854199409485, "